{{!
    @template local_mail/navbar

    Envelope link to the inbox in the navigation bar, with the unread-count badge.

    Classes required for JS:
    * local-mail-navbar-count: the badge local_mail/navbar fills and shows.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * url: URL of the inbox.
    * title: Name of the plugin, the link's title.
    * showcount: Whether to print the badge, false on the mailbox itself.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "url": "https://example.com/local/mail/view.php?t=inbox",
        "title": "Mail",
        "showcount": true
    }
}}
<div class="popover-region" id="local-mail-navbar">
    <a href="{{url}}" class="nav-link btn h-100 position-relative d-flex align-items-center px-2 py-0" title="{{title}}">
        <i class="fa fa-fw fa-envelope-o icon m-0 local-mail-navbar-icon"></i>
        {{#showcount}}
        <span class="local-mail-navbar-count count-container" hidden="hidden"></span>
        {{/showcount}}
    </a>
</div>
